cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Sandbagging Evidence Standard, please cite this release."
title: "Toward an Evidence Standard for Sandbagging Claims: A Literature Synthesis, Reference Implementation and Worked Application"
type: article
authors:
  - given-names: "Torin"
    family-names: "Ethreidge"
    affiliation: "Xysera Research"
version: 1.0.0-rc1
date-released: 2026-10-25
abstract: >-
  A proposed, operational evidence standard for grading claims of language-model
  sandbagging, accompanied by a source ledger, reference implementation, synthetic
  14 tests, worked application to 166,250 preregistered trials, sensitivity analysis,
  and a small exploratory screen.
keywords:
  - artificial intelligence safety
  - language models
  - sandbagging
  - strategic underperformance
  - capability evaluation
  - evaluation integrity
repository-code: "https://github.com/Xysera/ses-research"
